WEBVTT

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:02.096
I heard the recorder
call the first person's name.

00:02:02.120 --> 00:02:03.816
"Joe Smith."

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:08.136
The person responsible
for presenting Joe's case did just that.

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:11.176
Three quarters of the way through,
someone interrupted and said,

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:13.456
"This is a great candidate, outstanding,

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:16.296
has great analytical
and quantitative skills.

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:18.136
This is a superstar."

00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:19.656
The recorder then said,

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:22.760
"Sounds like Joe
should go in the top bucket."

00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:25.536
Second person, Mary Smith.

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:29.376
Halfway through that presentation,
someone said, "Solid candidate.

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:32.416
Nothing really special,
but a good pair of hands."